  "canon:title": "Nontraumatic dissecting aneurysm of the basilar artery.",
  "canon:abstract": "A case of nontraumatic dissecting aneurysm of the basilar artery in association with hypertension, smoke, and oral contraceptives is reported in a young female patient with a locked-in syndrome.",
